{
  "uid": "grid-bot-alerts",
  "title": "Grid Bot / Alerts",
  "description": "The alerts that are firing or pending per environment, how they changed over time, and where to investigate each one.",
  "version": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "tags": [
    "grid-bot"
  ],
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "dashboards",
      "title": "Grid Bot",
      "tags": [
        "grid-bot"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true,
      "icon": "external link",
      "targetBlank": false,
      "tooltip": "",
      "url": ""
    }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "Restarts",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "blue",
        "expr": "sum(changes(process_start_time_seconds{environment=\"$environment\"}[1m])) > 0",
        "titleFormat": "Restart",
        "step": "60s",
        "useValueForTime": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Data source",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "refresh": 1,
        "hide": 0,
        "current": {},
        "regex": "",
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false
      },
      {
        "name": "environment",
        "label": "Environment",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(gridbot_build_info, environment)",
          "refId": "StandardVariableQuery"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(gridbot_build_info, environment)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false,
        "hide": 0,
        "regex": "",
        "current": {}
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Now",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Firing",
      "description": "Grid Bot alerts that are firing.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count(ALERTS{alertname=~\"GridBot.*\",environment=\"$environment\",alertstate=\"firing\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Pending",
      "description": "Grid Bot alerts whose condition is true but have not yet been true for their full duration.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count(ALERTS{alertname=~\"GridBot.*\",environment=\"$environment\",alertstate=\"pending\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Active alerts",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Firing and pending alerts",
      "description": "Every alert that is firing or pending, with how long it has been active. An empty table means nothing is wrong.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "(time() - ALERTS_FOR_STATE{alertname=~\"GridBot.*\",environment=\"$environment\"}) * ignoring(alertstate) group_left(alertstate) ALERTS{alertname=~\"GridBot.*\",environment=\"$environment\",alertstate=~\"firing|pending\"}",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": false,
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Active for"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "s"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "alertstate"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "firing": {
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "pending": {
                        "color": "yellow",
                        "index": 1
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Active for",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "environment": true,
              "job": true,
              "instance": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "alertname": 0,
              "alertstate": 1,
              "severity": 2,
              "Value": 3
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "Active for"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "History",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "Alert state over time",
      "description": "When each alert was pending or firing. Alerts that did not fire in the range are not listed.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "max by (alertname) (ALERTS{alertname=~\"GridBot.*\",environment=\"$environment\",alertstate=\"firing\"}) * 2 or max by (alertname) (ALERTS{alertname=~\"GridBot.*\",environment=\"$environment\",alertstate=\"pending\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{alertname}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "lineWidth": 0
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "transparent",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "Pending",
                  "color": "yellow",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "2": {
                  "text": "Firing",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mergeValues": true,
        "showValue": "never",
        "alignValue": "left",
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Where to look",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "| Alert | Investigate |\n| --- | --- |\n| `GridBotHighErrorRate` | [Overview](/d/grid-bot-overview?${__url_time_range}&var-datasource=${datasource}&var-environment=${environment}), [Commands and Interactions](/d/grid-bot-commands?${__url_time_range}&var-datasource=${datasource}&var-environment=${environment}), [Traces](/d/grid-bot-traces?${__url_time_range}&var-datasource=${datasource}&var-environment=${environment}) |\n| `GridBotCommandLatencyHigh` | [Commands and Interactions](/d/grid-bot-commands?${__url_time_range}&var-datasource=${datasource}&var-environment=${environment}), [Traces](/d/grid-bot-traces?${__url_time_range}&var-datasource=${datasource}&var-environment=${environment}) |\n| `GridBotNoReadyGridInstances`, `GridBotGridJobsRejected` | [Grid and Discord](/d/grid-bot-grid?${__url_time_range}&var-datasource=${datasource}&var-environment=${environment}) |\n| `GridBotGatewayDisconnecting`, `GridBotGatewayLatencyHigh` | [Grid and Discord](/d/grid-bot-grid?${__url_time_range}&var-datasource=${datasource}&var-environment=${environment}) |\n| `GridBotClientSettingsRefreshFailing` | [Grid and Discord](/d/grid-bot-grid?${__url_time_range}&var-datasource=${datasource}&var-environment=${environment}) |\n| `GridBotHttp5xxRate` | [HTTP and gRPC](/d/grid-bot-http?${__url_time_range}&var-datasource=${datasource}&var-environment=${environment}) |\n| `GridBotInFlightNeverIdle` | [Overview](/d/grid-bot-overview?${__url_time_range}&var-datasource=${datasource}&var-environment=${environment}), [Scripts and Renders](/d/grid-bot-scripts-renders?${__url_time_range}&var-datasource=${datasource}&var-environment=${environment}) |"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25
      }
    }
  ]
}
